Description: oYo UI changer (Zenity-based)
 Simple UI changer for open.Yellow.os using Zenity dialogs.

Package: oyo-ui-changer-gtk
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4)
Description: oYo UI changer (GTK4/libadwaita preview)
 Preview build of the GTK4/libadwaita version of the open.Yellow.os UI
 changer, installed as oyo-ui-changer-gtk. It can be installed alongside
 the Zenity-based oyo-ui-changer and does not replace it.
